---
---

<section class="learn" id="learn-section">
  <h2>Here's what you'll learn:</h2>

  <div class="learn-grid">
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">01</div>
      <div class="ttl">Product Hunting:</div>
      <div class="body">How to identify a winning product and which products you must avoid.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">02</div>
      <div class="ttl">Finding a reliable supplier:</div>
      <div class="body">How to find a reliable supplier (locally and Alibaba) and negotiate the best prices.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <div class="ttl">Building the store:</div>
      <div class="body">How to build an online store on Shopify and set up Whish as your payment gateway.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">04</div>
      <div class="ttl">Create &amp; Run Ads:</div>
      <div class="body">How to create advertisements and run on social media to attract customers to your online store.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson">
      <div class="num">05</div>
      <div class="ttl">Q&amp;A with Majd:</div>
      <div class="body">Whatever question you have, Majd will answer them all to make sure you leave with a clear plan for starting your business.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bonus: spans the full grid width -->
    <div class="lesson bonus">
      <h3 class="bonus-title">Plus a very special gift for you!</h3>
      <div class="bonus-inner">
        <img class="bonus-img" src="/free guides.jpeg" alt="7 free Droparabia e-books" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="bonus-copy">
          <p class="bonus-body">7 Free E-books that contains everything you need to learn how to manage all aspects of your business from creating and running ads, copywriting, branding...</p>
          <p class="bonus-note">But only if you start till the end of the workshop</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .learn {
    background: #F0F0F0;
    /* Absorbs the spacer div this section used to carry above its heading. */
    padding: 80px 0 50px;
  }
  .learn h2 {
    margin: 0 0 50px;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #000;
  }

  .learn-grid {
    max-width: 1225px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .lesson:nth-child(-n+3) { grid-column: span 2; }
  .lesson:nth-child(4),
  .lesson:nth-child(5)    { grid-column: span 3; }

  .lesson {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    background-clip: padding-box;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2563eb, 0 14px 30px rgba(0,21,115,0.1);
  }
  .num {
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #2563eb;
  }
  .ttl {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #000;
  }
  .body {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #000;
  }

  /* Bonus card */
  .bonus {
    grid-column: 1 / span 6;
    position: relative;
    padding: 32px;
  }
  .bonus::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(20,173,0,0.08), transparent 45%);
    border-radius: 28px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bonus-title {
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bonus-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .bonus-img {
    width: 44%;
    max-width: 420px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bonus-copy {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bonus-body {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .bonus-note {
    font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #000;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .learn { padding-top: 20px; }
    .learn h2 { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .learn-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .lesson:nth-child(-n+3),
    .lesson:nth-child(4),
    .lesson:nth-child(5),
    .bonus { grid-column: 1; }
    .bonus { padding: 24px; }
    .bonus-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
    .bonus-img { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; }
    .bonus-body { font-size: 15px; }
    .bonus-note { font-size: 21px; }
  }
</style>
